---
/** Ported from reference/shap-postal-round.html. Keep copy and section order in step with it. */
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import ThemeToggle from '../components/ThemeToggle.astro';
import SketchMap from '../components/SketchMap.astro';
import { FACTS, LIMITS, STOPS } from '../lib/config.ts';
import { todayInShap } from '../lib/rounds.ts';

const today = todayInShap();
---
<Base
  title="The Shap Postal Round"
  description="Walk or run the last postal round in Shap, Cumbria: an 18 km loop from Birchwood Cafe through Swindale and Wet Sleddale, from Alan Cleaver's The Postal Paths."
>
  <header class="hero">
    <div class="wrap hero-grid">
      <div>
        <div class="kicker">
          <span class="slot" aria-hidden="true"></span>Shap, Cumbria
          <span class="theme"><ThemeToggle /></span>
        </div>
        <h1>Shap Postal Path</h1>
        <p class="strap">The loneliest postal path</p>
        <p class="lede">
          Until 1976 a postman walked the post out of Shap every morning: over the fields to Shap Abbey, up to isolated
          Tailbert, down into Swindale and over the fell to Wet Sleddale. Now you can walk or run the round yourself.
        </p>
        <blockquote class="quote">
          It broke my heart.
          <cite>Stuart Lewis, the last postman to walk the round, on being given a van</cite>
        </blockquote>
        <div class="actions">
          <a class="btn" href="#route">See the round</a>
          <a class="btn red" href="#log">Log your round</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <dl class="facts" aria-label="Route at a glance">
        {
          FACTS.map(([k, v]) => (
            <>
              <dt>{k}</dt>
              <dd>{v}</dd>
            </>
          ))
        }
      </dl>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main id="main">
    <section id="book">
      <div class="wrap book">
        <div class="book-card">
          <strong>The Postal Paths</strong>
          Rediscovering Britain’s forgotten trails and the people who walked them
          <div class="author">Alan Cleaver</div>
          <div>Monoray, 2025</div>
        </div>
        <div class="measure">
          <h2>Where the story comes from</h2>
          <p>
            Whitehaven author Alan Cleaver spent five years tracing the routes rural postmen and women walked, from the
            penny post of the 1840s until vans replaced them in the late 1960s and 1970s. His book follows those paths
            from the Outer Hebrides to the Cornish coast, and gathers the stories of the posties who walked them.
          </p>
          <p>
            These were long days. Rounds of 10 to 20 miles were common, walked six days a week in every weather, often by
            the same person for most of their working life. Where the road took too long, postmen made their own
            shortcuts. Many are still marked on maps as postman’s paths.
          </p>
          <p>
            Shap is one of the Cumbrian rounds in the book. Stuart Lewis walked its 15 miles until 1976, carrying a
            leather pouch to sell stamps and postal orders at the farms. Before him, in the 1950s, the round belonged to
            Jimmy Eland.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="route">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>The round</h2>
        <p class="measure">
          A circular route out of Shap and back, following Alan Cleaver’s mapping of the round. Start and finish at
          Birchwood Cafe, run by the family of one of the last postmen to walk it.
        </p>
        <div class="route">
          <SketchMap />
          <div>
            <ol class="stops">
              {
                STOPS.map((s) => (
                  <li>
                    <h3>{s.name}</h3>
                    <p set:html={s.html} />
                  </li>
                ))
              }
            </ol>
            <div class="safety">
              <strong>Before you go.</strong> This is a long, rough day with pathless, boggy sections. Mountain Rescue
              advise carrying a map and compass, and knowing how to use them, even if you have GPS. Check the forecast,
              tell someone your plan, and close every gate behind you.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="log">
      <div class="wrap log">
        <div class="measure">
          <h2>Log your round</h2>
          <p>
            Walked it or ran it? Add yourself to the round book. Upload the GPX file from your watch or phone and we check
            it starts and finishes in Shap and covers the whole loop.
          </p>
          <p>
            No GPX? Add a link to your Strava, Garmin or Komoot activity instead, or a photo from the Thorney Bank
            postbox. The Birchwood team checks entries without a GPX by hand.
          </p>
          <p class="hint">
            Your name, date and time appear on the public leaderboard. Your GPX file and photo are used to check your
            round and are not shown to others.
          </p>
        </div>

        <form id="f" novalidate>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="name">Your name</label>
            <input id="name" name="name" type="text" maxlength={LIMITS.nameMax} autocomplete="name" required />
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <span class="label" id="modelbl">How did you do it?</span>
            <div class="seg" role="radiogroup" aria-labelledby="modelbl">
              <label><input type="radio" name="mode" value="walk" checked /><span>Walked</span></label>
              <label><input type="radio" name="mode" value="run" /><span>Ran</span></label>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="gpx">GPX file <span class="hint">(recommended)</span></label>
            <div class="drop">
              <input id="gpx" type="file" accept=".gpx,application/gpx+xml,application/xml,text/xml" />
              <div class="gpxresult" id="gpxres" aria-live="polite"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="field">
              <label for="date">Date</label>
              <input id="date" name="date" type="date" required max={today} min={LIMITS.earliestDate} />
            </div>
            <div class="field">
              <span class="label" id="timelbl">Time taken</span>
              <div class="time" role="group" aria-labelledby="timelbl">
                <input id="hh" name="hours" type="text" inputmode="numeric" maxlength="2" placeholder="h" aria-label="Hours" />:
                <input id="mm" name="minutes" type="text" inputmode="numeric" maxlength="2" placeholder="mm" aria-label="Minutes" />
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="link">Activity link <span class="hint">(optional)</span></label>
            <input id="link" name="link" type="url" maxlength={LIMITS.linkMax} placeholder="https://www.strava.com/activities/…" />
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="photo">Photo evidence <span class="hint">(optional)</span></label>
            <input id="photo" type="file" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp" />
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="note">A line for the round book <span class="hint">(optional)</span></label>
            <textarea id="note" name="note" rows="2" maxlength={LIMITS.noteMax} placeholder="Snow on Glede Howe, tea at Birchwood after"></textarea>
          </div>
          <div class="hp" aria-hidden="true">
            <label for="website">Leave this empty</label>
            <input id="website" name="website" type="text" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" />
          </div>
          <button class="btn red" type="submit" id="submit">Add my round</button>
          <div class="msg" id="msg" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
        </form>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="board">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>The round book</h2>
        <div class="board-head">
          <p style="margin:0" id="count">Everyone who has completed the Shap round, newest first.</p>
          <div class="tabs" role="group" aria-label="Sort leaderboard">
            <button type="button" data-view="date" aria-pressed="true">By date</button>
            <button type="button" data-view="run" aria-pressed="false">Fastest runs</button>
            <button type="button" data-view="walk" aria-pressed="false">Fastest walks</button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="tablewrap">
          <table>
            <thead>
              <tr><th scope="col">#</th><th scope="col">Name</th><th scope="col">Date</th><th scope="col">Time</th><th scope="col">Evidence</th></tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody id="rows"></tbody>
          </table>
          <div class="empty" id="empty">Loading the round book…</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="wrap cols">
      <div>
        <h3>Birchwood Cafe</h3>
        <p>Birchwood House, Main Street, Shap CA10 3NJ<br />Tuesday to Saturday, 9am to 4pm<br />01931 749033</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Read and listen</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Alan Cleaver, <em>The Postal Paths</em> (Monoray, 2025)</li>
          <li>Alan Cleaver’s Hidden Cumbria route notes for the Shap postman’s path</li>
          <li>Countrystride podcast #43, Shap and the Postman’s Path</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Walk responsibly</h3>
        <p>
          Much of the route crosses working farmland. Keep dogs on leads near stock, use gates and stiles, and leave no
          trace.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    import '../scripts/home.ts';
  </script>
</Base>

<style is:global>
  /* hero */
  .hero { padding: 3.5rem 0 4rem; border-top: 0; position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
  .hero-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.25fr 1fr; gap: 2.5rem; align-items: end; }
  .kicker { font-family: var(--sans); font-weight: 500; color: var(--ink-soft); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.6rem; }
  .kicker .theme { margin-left: auto; }
  .slot { display: inline-block; width: 2.2rem; height: 0.55rem; background: var(--red); border-radius: 2px; }
  .hero h1 { font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 8vw, 5.6rem); color: var(--fell); margin-bottom: 0.15em; }
  .strap { font-style: italic; font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 3vw, 1.9rem); color: var(--red); margin-bottom: 1.2rem; }
  .hero .lede { font-size: 1.3rem; color: var(--ink); max-width: 34rem; }
  .quote { border-left: 4px solid var(--red); padding: 0.2rem 0 0.2rem 1.1rem; margin: 1.8rem 0 0; font-style: italic; font-size: 1.35rem; }
  .quote cite { display: block; font-style: normal; font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--ink-soft); margin-top: 0.35rem; }
  .facts { font-family: var(--sans); display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto 1fr; gap: 0.55rem 1.2rem; background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 6px; padding: 1.4rem 1.5rem; margin: 0; }
  .facts dt { color: var(--ink-soft); }
  .facts dd { margin: 0; font-weight: 700; }
  .actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.75rem; margin-top: 2rem; }

  /* book */
  .book { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.4fr; gap: 3rem; align-items: start; }
  .book-card { background: var(--fell); color: #eef1e8; padding: 2rem; border-radius: 4px; font-family: var(--sans); }
  .book-card strong { font-family: var(--serif); font-size: 1.9rem; display: block; line-height: 1.1; margin-bottom: 0.4rem; color: #fff; }
  .book-card .author { margin-top: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.02em; }
  :root[data-theme='dark'] .book-card { color: #141a13; }
  :root[data-theme='dark'] .book-card strong { color: #141a13; }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    :root:not([data-theme='light']) .book-card, :root:not([data-theme='light']) .book-card strong { color: #141a13; }
  }

  /* route */
  .route { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 1fr; gap: 2.5rem; align-items: start; }
  .mapbox { background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 6px; padding: 0.75rem; position: sticky; top: calc(1rem + env(safe-area-inset-top, 0px)); }
  .mapbox svg { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; }
  .mapnote { font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--ink-soft); margin: 0.5rem 0.25rem 0; }
  ol.stops { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; counter-reset: s; }
  ol.stops li { counter-increment: s; position: relative; padding: 0 0 1.4rem 3.1rem; border-left: 2px dashed var(--red); margin-left: 1rem; }
  ol.stops li:last-child { border-left-color: transparent; }
  ol.stops li::before { content: counter(s); position: absolute; left: -1.05rem; top: -0.1rem; width: 2rem; height: 2rem; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--paper); border: 2px solid var(--red); color: var(--red); font-family: var(--sans); font-weight: 700; display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 0.95rem; }
  ol.stops h3 { margin: 0 0 0.2rem; font-size: 1.15rem; }
  ol.stops p { margin: 0; font-size: 1.02rem; color: var(--ink-soft); }
  .safety { margin-top: 2rem; background: var(--paper-2); border-radius: 6px; padding: 1.3rem 1.4rem; font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 1rem; }
  .safety strong { color: var(--red); }

  /* log */
  .log { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.25fr; gap: 3rem; align-items: start; }
  form#f { font-family: var(--sans); background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 6px; padding: 1.5rem; min-width: 0; }
  .field { margin-bottom: 1rem; min-width: 0; }
  form#f label, form#f .label { display: block; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.3rem; }
  form#f input[type='text'], form#f input[type='date'], form#f input[type='url'], form#f textarea {
    width: 100%; font: inherit; font-size: 1rem; padding: 0.6rem 0.7rem; border: 1.5px solid var(--line); border-radius: 4px; background: var(--paper); color: var(--ink);
  }
  form#f input[type='file'] { max-width: 100%; font: inherit; font-size: 1rem; }
  .row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 0.8rem; }
  .seg { display: flex; border: 1.5px solid var(--line); border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden; }
  form#f .seg label { flex: 1; margin: 0; text-align: center; padding: 0.55rem; cursor: pointer; font-weight: 500; }
  .seg input { position: absolute; opacity: 0; pointer-events: none; }
  .seg label:has(input:checked) { background: var(--fell); color: var(--paper); }
  .seg label:has(input:focus-visible) { outline: 3px solid var(--red); outline-offset: -3px; }
  .time { display: flex; gap: 0.4rem; align-items: center; }
  form#f .time input { width: 4.5rem; text-align: center; }
  .drop { border: 2px dashed var(--line); border-radius: 6px; padding: 1rem; text-align: center; background: var(--paper); }
  .gpxresult { margin-top: 0.7rem; font-size: 0.95rem; text-align: left; }
  .gpxresult ul { margin: 0.3rem 0 0; padding-left: 1.1rem; }
  .msg { margin-top: 0.8rem; font-weight: 500; }
  .msg.err { color: var(--red); }
  .hp { position: absolute; left: -9999px; width: 1px; height: 1px; overflow: hidden; }

  /* board */
  .board-head { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.6rem; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 1rem; font-family: var(--sans); }
  .tabs { display: flex; gap: 0.3rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .tabs button { font: inherit; font-weight: 500; border: 1.5px solid var(--line); background: transparent; color: var(--ink); padding: 0.4rem 0.8rem; border-radius: 999px; cursor: pointer; }
  .tabs button[aria-pressed='true'] { background: var(--ink); color: var(--paper); border-color: var(--ink); }
  .tablewrap { overflow-x: auto; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 6px; background: var(--card); }
  .tablewrap table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 1rem; min-width: 520px; }
  .tablewrap th, .tablewrap td { text-align: left; padding: 0.7rem 0.8rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); vertical-align: top; }
  .tablewrap th { font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 0.92rem; }
  .tablewrap tr:last-child td { border-bottom: 0; }
  .tablewrap td.pos { font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.2rem; color: var(--fell); width: 2.5rem; }
  .who { font-weight: 700; }
  .sub { color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 0.88rem; }
  .empty { padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem; text-align: center; font-family: var(--sans); color: var(--ink-soft); }
  .empty[hidden] { display: none; }

  footer { padding: 3rem 0 4rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); font-family: var(--sans); font-size: 0.98rem; color: var(--ink-soft); }
  footer .cols { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 2rem; }
  footer h3 { color: var(--ink); font-size: 1.1rem; }
  footer ul { padding-left: 1.1rem; margin: 0; }

  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .hero-grid, .book, .route, .log, footer .cols { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .mapbox { position: static; }
    section { padding: 3.2rem 0; }
  }
</style>
